Description: Provides implementations of gradient boosting,
    random forest regression, neural network regression, decision
    stumps, and binary random forest classification. The package
    provides a unified modelling interface, prediction functions,
    cross-validation examples, and native implementations using
    'Rcpp' and 'RcppArmadillo'.
